<section class="page-hero band">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">The founder</p>
    <h1>Independent by design. Built with AI. Reviewed by hand.</h1>
    <p class="lead">I'm Antony S. — a freelance web architect and the solo founder of Ancya Tech. I build fast, careful websites and AI automations for small businesses that have outgrown templates but don't want an agency's overhead.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section band-white has-ribbon ribbon--wave">
