      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="fp-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-users"/></svg></span>
        <div><h3>Independent, and accountable for it.</h3><p>You work directly with the person doing the work — no account managers, no hand-offs, no team you never meet.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="fp-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg></span>
        <div><h3>Socially responsible by default.</h3><p>Usable on modest phones, legible type and contrast, no dark patterns — the web should work for the businesses that keep our towns running.</p></div>
