        <span class="fp-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-rocket"/></svg></span>
        <div><h3>Built for the next five years.</h3><p>Modern, maintainable stacks and structured content, so a site can keep growing and stay findable as search moves into AI assistants.</p></div>
